#. TRANSLATORS: {error} is a technical parse error; {unit} is
#. hid-labd.service. Keep the command between backticks as is.
#: crates/hidlab-gtk/src/dbus.rs:66
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The Cursiva service sent a status this app does not understand ({error}). "
"The service and the app are probably different versions: install both from "
"the same build, then run `systemctl --user restart {unit}`"
msgstr "El servicio de Cursiva envió un estado que esta app no entiende ({error}). Probablemente el servicio y la app son de versiones distintas: instala ambos de la misma compilación y luego ejecuta `systemctl --user restart {unit}`"

#. TRANSLATORS: {unit} is hid-labd.service. Keep commands as is.
#: crates/hidlab-gtk/src/dbus.rs:81
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The Cursiva service (hid-labd) is not installed for this user, or the "
"session bus has not read its service file yet. Install it as the README "
"says, then run `systemctl --user enable --now {unit}`"
msgstr "El servicio de Cursiva (hid-labd) no está instalado para este usuario, o el bus de sesión aún no ha leído su archivo de servicio. Instálalo como indica el README y luego ejecuta `systemctl --user enable --now {unit}`"

#. TRANSLATORS: {unit} is hid-labd.service. Keep the command as is.
#: crates/hidlab-gtk/src/dbus.rs:89
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The Cursiva service could not start. See why with `journalctl --user -u "
"{unit} -n 50`"
msgstr "El servicio de Cursiva no pudo arrancar. Mira por qué con `journalctl --user -u {unit} -n 50`"

#. TRANSLATORS: {error} is the D-Bus error message; {unit} is
#. hid-labd.service. Keep the command as is.
#: crates/hidlab-gtk/src/dbus.rs:95
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The Cursiva service did not answer ({error}). Check it with `systemctl --"
